 "_source": "Ministry of Corporate Affairs, Corporate Data Management Cell, as printed in its reply to Lok Sabha Unstarred Question No. 161 (20 July 2026), data updated to 31 March 2026. Census 2011 population and 2020-21 to 2022-23 per capita NSDP from data.gov.in; 2023-24 and 2024-25 per capita NSDP from MoSPI National Accounts",
 "_source_url": "https://sansad.in/getFile/lsapps/loksabhaquestions/annex/188/AU161_1zCBRl.pdf?source=lsapps",
